sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant PyServer as Python Feature Server<br/>:6566/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant GoServer as Go Feature Server<br/>HTTP/gRPC
    participant AuthManager as SecurityManager /<br/>AuthManager (Python)
    participant OnlineStore as Online Store<br/>(PostgreSQL / Redis / Valkey)
    participant Registry as Registry Server<br/>gRPC + REST
    participant RegistryBackend as Registry Backend<br/>(S3 / GCS / Database)
    participant Operator as Feast Operator<br/>controller-runtime
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>:6443 HTTPS
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>ServiceMonitor

    Note over Client,OnlineStore: Feature Retrieval Flow (Online)

    Client->>PyServer: POST /get-online-features<br/>Bearer Token (if auth enabled)
    PyServer->>AuthManager: inject_user_details()<br/>Extract & validate token
    AuthManager-->>PyServer: User context set
    PyServer->>OnlineStore: Read feature vectors
    OnlineStore-->>PyServer: Feature data
    PyServer-->>Client: JSON Response

    Client->>GoServer: POST /get-online-features<br/>No auth enforcement
    GoServer->>OnlineStore: Read feature vectors<br/>(pgx / go-redis)
    OnlineStore-->>GoServer: Feature data
    GoServer-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Client,RegistryBackend: Registry Management Flow

    Client->>Registry: gRPC ApplyEntity / REST POST /entities
    Registry->>AuthManager: Validate token (if configured)
    AuthManager-->>Registry: Authorized
    Registry->>RegistryBackend: Persist metadata
    RegistryBackend-->>Registry: Confirmation
    Registry-->>Client: Success response

    Note over Operator,K8sAPI: Operator Reconciliation Flow

    K8sAPI->>Operator: Watch event: FeatureStore CR created/updated
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Deployment<br/>ServiceAccount token (in-cluster)
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Service, ConfigMap, RBAC
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update HPA, PDB, CronJob
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ServiceMonitor
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update OpenShift Route (if applicable)

    Note over Operator,K8sAPI: Notebook ConfigMap Injection

    K8sAPI->>Operator: Watch event: Kubeflow Notebook created
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Inject FeatureStore ConfigMap<br/>into notebook namespace

    Note over GoServer,Prometheus: Observability Flow

    Prometheus->>Operator: GET :8443/metrics<br/>TLS + TokenReview + SAR
    Operator-->>Prometheus: Operator metrics
    Prometheus->>GoServer: GET /metrics
    GoServer-->>Prometheus: Feature server metrics
